OL,3,ATrial of German steakhouse heiress that
OL,4,Asparked a huge spy scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a trial that has gripped Germany,
OL,7,Fwith a wealthy heiress in the dock for
OL,8,Fmonths and a case that triggered the
OL,9,Fcountry's biggest espionage scandal in
OL,10,Frecent history.
OL,12,FChristina Block, heir to a popular
OL,13,Fchain of steakhouses, is accused of
OL,14,Fordering an Israeli security firm to
OL,15,Fcarry out the violent abduction of her
OL,16,Fchildren from Denmark, following a
OL,17,Fbitter custody battle with her former
OL,18,Fhusband.
OL,20,FThere are allegedly connections with at
OL,21,Fleast two former secret agents, from
OL,22,FGermany and Israel.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
